      "value": "There should be the freedom to refuse gifts.\n\nIt was different when I was the one receiving a gift, but is it really necessary to be grateful even for gifts from people you dislike?\n\nWhat should someone do if they don’t want to feel indebted to others?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
